---
title: "risk_level_calculation - Risk Level and Health Check (Scallop Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_prices: fetch oracle prices for all collateral and debt assets
    q_get_prices --> q_calc_collateral_borrow: for each collateral asset i

    q_calc_collateral_borrow --> q_sum_collateral: collateral_value_i = amount_i * price_i * collateral_weight_i
    q_sum_collateral --> q_calc_collateral_liq: borrowing_capacity = sum(collateral_value_i)

    q_calc_collateral_liq --> q_sum_liq: liq_threshold_i = amount_i * price_i * liquidation_factor_i
    q_sum_liq --> q_calc_debt: required_collateral_value = sum(liq_threshold_i)

    q_calc_debt --> q_sum_debt: for each debt asset j
    q_sum_debt --> q_calc_risk: debt_value_j = debt_amount_j * price_j * borrow_weight_j
    q_calc_risk --> q_determine: borrow_value_weighted = sum(debt_value_j)

    q_determine --> q_healthy: risk_level = borrow_value_weighted / required_collateral_value
    q_healthy --> [*]: risk_level < 100% (safe)
    q_determine --> q_unhealthy: risk_level >= 100%
    q_unhealthy --> [*]: position eligible for liquidation

    note right of q_calc_collateral_borrow
        INV-001: collateral_weight < 1.0 for all assets (safety margin)
        INV-002: liquidation_factor > collateral_weight (liquidation threshold higher than borrow limit)
    end note

    note right of q_calc_risk
        INV-003: borrow_weight >= 1.0 (volatile assets weighted higher to reduce borrowable amount)
        INV-004: risk_level = 0 when no debt exists
        INV-005: risk_level is undefined when no collateral exists and debt > 0 (should never happen)
    end note

    note right of q_determine
        INV-006: position is healthy iff borrow_value_weighted < required_collateral_value
        INV-007: borrowing is allowed only when borrow_value_weighted < borrowing_capacity
    end note
